ptain Caine for an apocalyptic clash!\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Full cover artwork","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox comic\n| issue             = 11\n| image             = File:HM11 Seekers of Ys cover.jpeg\n| released           = June 2010\n| writer            = [[Sean Molyneaux]]\n| director          = [[Simone Borselli]]\n| italian           = I cercatori di Ys\n| mission           = \n| new characters    = [[Bonnie]] <br> [[Celina]]\n| new titans        = \n| new powerbondings = \n| new spells        = [[Clatterbang]]<br>[[Knifepoint]]\n| new items         = \n| new locations     = Brittany, France<br>[[Ys]]\n| see also          =\n| previous          = [[Mission to Skara Brae]]\n| next              = [[The Lost City of Casterwill]]\n}}\n'''Seeker of Ys''' is the 11th issue of the ''[[Huntik Magazine]]'' comic book series.\n\n== Synopsis ==\nThe Huntik team land in Brittany as they embark on a treasure hunt, following clues that will lead them to the statue of Gradlon the Great, the Bay of Death and finally to the mythical lost city of Ys. But [[the Organization]] does not stand by and unleashes [[Bonnie]] and [[Celina]], who team up with [[Dr. Rickman]] and [[Captain Caine]] for an apocalyptic clash!\n\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery>\nFile:Seekers of Ys.jpg|Full cover artwork\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Comics| 11]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","categories":["Comics"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:25991","status":"resolved","target_title":"Sean Molyneaux","label":"Sean Molyneaux","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sean_Molyneaux","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A25991"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:21689","status":"resolved","target_title":"Simone Borselli","label":"Simone Borselli","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Simone_Borselli","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A21689"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:17002","status":"resolved","target_title":"Bonnie","label":"Bonnie","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Bonnie","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17002"},{